# ── Large simulation inputs/outputs (produced by Component 1, not versioned) ──
# The APSIM grid results are big (~30 MB) and machine-produced. Only the small
# aggregated app/data/yield-surface.csv is committed.
# Input caches — downloaded once, big; not versioned
simulation/input/weather/
simulation/input/soil/
current_season/input/weather/
# Pipeline outputs — regenerated; inspect locally in output/plots/
**/output/*.rds
**/output/*.csv
**/output/*.json
**/output/*.log
**/output/checkpoints/
**/output/apsim-work/
**/output/plots/*.png

